Z||000006||varnster||01-08-2001||09:52 PM||||Sounds alot like mine, color, and all, mine<BR>has a few more extras, with 100k on the odom<BR>But carrie was in better than average condition every thing works great,very quick<BR>needed the usual interior fixes and I paid<BR>1600. so I would talk him down a bit, if you<BR>can. But if your area is like mine there are not to many of these burgandy babies left. And finally I guarantee you will love <BR>the 6 banger over the 4. But thats my opinion.  ||||reg||1
